  "decision_conditions": [
    "It has not been demonstrated that the proposed car parking arrangement would be safe, usable, that vehicles could access/egress the site independent of each other and that there would be no adverse impact on the existing car parking arrangement at No 56 Ladywood Road. As such, the proposal would likely result in increased demand for car parking spaces on Ladywood Road which would exacerbate congestion and inconsiderate car parking which could impact on the highway safety, contrary to Paragraph 116 of the NPPF, 2024 and Policies DM9 and DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012.\r"
